  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c4vmDfS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/608760849544249375?color=orange&label=Discord&logo=Discord\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/cweckerl/simplefarming/gradle.yml\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/cweckerl/simplefarming\" alt=\"issues\"></a></p>\n<p>Simple Farming 是一款適用於 Minecraft 1.14+ 的農業模組。</p>\n<h5><strong>功能特色</strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li>新增作物</li>\n<li>漿果叢</li>\n<li>果樹</li>\n<li>新餐點</li>\n<li>釀酒</li>\n</ul>\n<h5><strong>相容模組</strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/right-click-get-crops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Right Click, Get Crops</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5><strong>資源包</strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/beautycrops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BeautyCrops</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5><strong>反饋</strong></h5>\n<p>如有任何問題，請在 GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a> 上提交。如果您想建議新功能，歡迎加入社群 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/c4vmDfS\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p>\n<h5><strong>免責聲明</strong></h5>\n<p>CurseForge 是唯一上傳構建版本的網站。從其他網站下載模組時請謹慎。</p>\n<h5><strong>貢獻者</strong></h5>\n<p>感謝您對 Simple Farming 的支持！如果您想要翻譯此模組，請加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/c4vmDfS\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 以獲取更多資訊。<a href=\"https://github.com/cweckerl/simplefarming/blob/1.15/CONTRIBUTORS.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>是所有傑出貢獻者的持續更新名單。</p>",
